 school players and at  the scholastic level and they all  stopped playing when they go to college  so creating more chess club's  and giving them opportunities to pursue  it even you know at a less competitive  level I think is extremely important  well Sunil thank you very much for  taking the time to speak with us and  share your ideas and  I'm sure we'll see you around because  you were here with Hikaru of course  watching his games and suffering  alongside him thank you very much to him
 

